@startuml
title FullMatch as checked FLT evidence in a Rholang where clause
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #37474F
  FontColor #102027
  RoundCorner 16
}

rectangle "RSpace candidate\ntext binding" as candidate #DCEEFF
rectangle "Explicit language handle\nand typed FLT template" as flt #BBDEFB
rectangle "Checked FullMatch action\nsemantic transition kernel" as kernel #D1C4E9
rectangle "Exact terminal-key\npredicate classification" as classify #FFF9C4
rectangle "Sat\nvalid commit receipt\nCOMM fires" as sat #C8E6C9
rectangle "Unsat\nno match" as unsat #FFCDD2
rectangle "DontKnow / refusal\nno consumption" as unknown #FFE0B2

candidate --> flt
flt --> kernel : authorize and parse
kernel --> classify : all completed results
classify --> sat : uniformly DoneBool(BTrue)
classify --> unsat : uniformly DoneBool(BFalse)
classify --> unknown : other, mixed, empty, or exhausted

note bottom of unknown
  Fail-closed admission is not
  a Boolean false judgment.
end note
@enduml
